        "title": "声: count actions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "声 after a suitable verb counts a cry or utterance. It measures the action, not a physical object.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他笑了一声。",
                "pinyin": "tā xiào le yī shēng 。",
                "meaning": "He gave one laugh.",
